WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.240
The last hour before a deadline is no time to find a gap.

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:09.330
See which evidence backs each answer, and bring in a colleague to review it.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:13.900
Export your response as a Word or PDF pack, with your compliance matrix.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.550
Then submit it yourself in the buyer's portal.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.800
Velstrian Bid.
